    "heading": "Disadvantage",
    "lineStart": 13179,
    "lineEnd": 13181
  },
  "section": "8.60",
  "rulesText": "If you have Disadvantage on a D20 Test, roll two d20s and use the lower roll. A roll can't be affected by more than one Disadvantage, and Advantage and Disadvantage on the same roll cancel each other. See also \"Playing the Game\" (\"D20 Tests\")."
}
